1
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,670
Hello, I have a package for you.

2
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,010
A package for me?

3
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:20,670
I didn't order anything.

4
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,460
Who's it addressed to?

5
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:24,370
There's no name.

6
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:32,420
[Let it sit after opening, or the jellyfish may die]

7
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,010
Hello?

8
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:08,590
I live in apartment 1301.

9
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:10,560
I noticed a box outside your door.

10
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,940
It's the aquarium I ordered.

11
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:14,290
I put in the wrong address.

12
00:01:14,790 --> 00:01:15,620
Sorry about that.

13
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,870
Could you bring it out for me?

14
00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:20,410
Hello?

15
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,020
I can hear you in there.

16
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:38,900
I know someone's home.

17
00:01:39,230 --> 00:01:40,740
Can I please have my package back?

18
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,660
Your TV is really loud every day.

19
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,770
Could you please turn it down?

20
00:01:49,230 --> 00:01:50,210
And after midnight,

21
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:52,020
could you stop inviting people over to play mahjong?

22
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:53,330
If it happens again,

23
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:54,570
I'm filing a complaint.

24
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:40,500
♪Forgive me for overthinking♪

25
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:42,660
♪Like a shadow, a dream, or the wind♪

26
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:45,580
♪What if there's no single answer?♪

27
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:51,260
♪Sometimes silence, sometimes emptiness♪

28
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:54,140
♪Sometimes it rains, sometimes all is hazy♪

29
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:58,900
♪Promises I can barely bring myself to make♪

30
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:01,420
♪At dusk, the leaves drift down♪

31
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:04,100
♪Somewhere at the city's edge, pieces of me remain♪

32
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:06,620
♪So many words I never meant♪

33
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:09,220
♪I've lost track of all the twists and turns♪

34
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:13,580
♪Gently kissing the tenderness in your eyes♪

35
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:16,340
♪Letting it all wash over me♪

36
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:21,220
♪Lost in memories of wasted time♪

37
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:23,460
♪Hold me close on nights I wake from dreams♪

38
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:26,140
♪There will always be regrets♪

39
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:27,700
♪That never shed a tear♪

40
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:29,380
♪But prove that I was here♪

41
00:03:29,620 --> 00:03:32,340
♪They keep haunting me, leaving me unsteady♪

42
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:36,580
♪What color will tomorrow be?♪

43
